message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "EEG NeuroAction: resultados, análisis y visualización interactiva"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: "Web viewer and technical results from the EEG NeuroAction pipeline for exploring BANDPOWER-derived EEG features, cleaning variants, motor-class models, and interactive visualizations. This repository archives published outputs from a Kaggle run; it does not include raw EEG or the computational pipeline source. Provenance and authorship follow the Kaggle dataset EEG 25-1."
